# Allowlist (stage 06, T3): only what the image build needs reaches
# the daemon. Anything else in the workdir — fotos outside ./fotos,
# local secrets/config (.env, .aws, .codex, .agents, ...), venvs,
# caches, docs by stage — is never sent, including to a remote builder.
*
!Dockerfile
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!app/
!yolo11n.pt
# Caches are excluded even inside the allowed app/ tree.
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
